WEBVTT

00:37:26.500 --> 00:37:30.393
I mean, this people pleaser,
it's a history of life.

00:37:30.417 --> 00:37:32.309
It's not something you become one day.

00:37:32.333 --> 00:37:35.643
It's the way you learned
to maintain your attachments.

00:37:35.667 --> 00:37:40.476
People pleaser is when you have learned
that unless you fulfill the conditions,

00:37:40.500 --> 00:37:42.434
the people who need to take care of you

00:37:42.458 --> 00:37:45.184
won't be doing it
in the way that they should.

00:37:45.208 --> 00:37:49.809
People pleaser is a fear
of not what happens when you please,

00:37:49.833 --> 00:37:51.809
but what happens, you know,

00:37:51.833 --> 00:37:55.976
how attuned you have become
at what displeasure can mean for others.

00:37:56.000 --> 00:37:58.476
And therefore,
it's an avoidance of conflict.

00:37:58.500 --> 00:38:00.351
And therefore, I can say yes to you